  "body": "Discover exceptional family living at 13 Pekanga Road with this beautifully designed 319.7sqm, 6-bedroom home set on a generous 595sqm section. Perfectly crafted for large or extended families, this impressive home offers 6 spacious bedrooms, multiple living zones, and premium finishes throughout.\r\n\r\n•\tSave money and time, deal directly with the builders. Call Arup on 021 777 155\r\n\r\nFeaturing 3 separate living areas on the ground floor plus an additional upstairs lounge, there’s plenty of room for everyone to relax, entertain, or enjoy their own space. The stunning designer kitchen is the heart of the home, complete with a full scullery and additional cooktop — ideal for busy families, entertainers, or multi-generational living.\r\nThe luxurious master suite is designed as a private retreat, boasting a large walk-in wardrobe and a beautifully appointed ensuite with its own bathtub for added comfort and style.\r\n\r\nYour home includes\r\n•\t10 years master build guarantee\r\n•\t6 spacious bedrooms\r\n•\t3 living areas downstairs + 1 upstairs living area\r\n•\tDesigner kitchen with full scullery & extra cooktop\r\n•\tDucted air con system\r\n•\tLarge master suite with walk-in wardrobe & ensuite bathtub\r\n•\tIdeal for extended family living\r\n•\tGenerous 595sqm section\r\n•\tEngineered stone kitchen benchtops with soft-close cabinetry\r\n•\tGenerous 2.7m stud height on the ground floor\r\n•\tDucted air-conditioning system\r\n•\tSecurity alarm system\r\n•\tGas infinity hot water\r\n•\tBosch stainless steel appliances\r\n•\tCompleted patio, driveway, and pathways• Approx. 319sqm floor area\r\n•\t Quality craftsmanship and thoughtful design throughout\r\n\r\nPlease note: Pricing excludes phone connection charges/levies (if applicable), window treatments.\r\n\r\nGet in touch:\r\n\r\nCall Arup on 021 777 155 at Golstruct Homes for more information, or visit our office at\r\n5–6 / 177 Millwater Parkway, Millwater.\r\n\r\nThis is a fantastic opportunity to secure a high-quality home in a prime coastal location—don’t miss it.",
